The dish is a square plate, roughly 20-22 cm across (it spans about 350 px in the image). The bagel half is about 175 px wide, so it measures roughly 10 cm across. That fits a bagel half, probably whole wheat or multigrain, spread with cream cheese.

A half bagel of that size weighs about 45-50 g and has about 130 kcal. The cream cheese layer looks like roughly 20 g, which adds about 70 kcal. Together that is about 68 g and 200 kcal.

